          ],
          "returnType": "Synchronous",
          "description": "Act on a frame that is already out of the application's hands. Called once per frame, after the backend has flushed and the frame-time statistic has been written - a diagnostic overlay reporting true frame cost, a network system sending state once the frame is drawn, work that wants whatever time the frame has left. budget reports the time remaining before the frame reaches its target duration; see FrameBudget. It is the only phase handed one, because it is the only point in the frame at which the figure is meaningful. Scene-graph mutation is allowed here and is picked up by the next frame's consumers rather than this one's."
        },
