          "returnType": "Synchronous",
          "description": "Advance by the variable frame delta, *before* this frame's fixed steps. Called once per frame, ahead of every other phase. This is where per-frame state has to be brought in sync with the incoming frame so the simulation sees it: the engine's own input, interaction, audio, tween and rendering systems all run here. Anything that must be current *before* physics runs belongs in this phase - a system reading input in SystemMethods.update would see the previous frame's snapshot, because update runs after the fixed steps."
        },
